        "must",
        "have to",
        "has to"
      ],
      "pos": "verb",
      "lesson": "u12-l02",
      "notes": "X-কে + infinitive + হবে: আমাকে যেতে হবে \"I have to go\". Same word as হবে \"will be\"; the verb never changes for the person."
    },
    {
